Source: tomar
Section: user/network
Priority: optional
Maintainer: norayr chilingarian <norayr@arnet.am>
Build-Depends:
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
 fpc,
 fp-compiler,
 fp-utils,
 fp-units-base,
 fp-units-fcl,
 fp-units-gfx,
 fp-units-gtk2,
 fp-units-math,
 fp-units-misc,
 fp-units-rtl,
 lcl,
 lcl-gtk2,
 lazarus
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: tomar
Section: user/network
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends}
escription: Simple, hopefully mobile friendly RSS/Atom reader.
 You can also subscribe to youtube feeds with it. Just paste a
 Youtube user profile URL and tomar will automatically find the
 feed and subscribe to it.
 It has buttons to watch with lower/higher resolution, as well
 as a button to install a latest yt-dlp to ~/bin directory.
XSBC-Bugtracker: mailto:norayr@arnet.am
